    "story.title": "Welcome to *KERA*",
    "story.lead": "In Georgian, KERA means hearth — the heart of a home, where people gather, share food and spend time together.",
    "story.body": "Welcome to KERA, a modern Georgian restaurant in Brussels. We bring Georgian cooking traditions together with an Azerbaijani touch, a contemporary approach and warm hospitality.\n\nWe believe a good meal is about more than food. It is about sharing the table, enjoying the moment and feeling welcome.",
